@startuml
title Selected Architecture 1 - Local MVP and Separate Full Product
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Lab 7 desktop MVP" {
  [Swing Presentation] as Swing
  [Application Use Cases] as App
  [Domain Model and Policies] as Domain
  database "Local SQLite" as SQLite
  [Local Outbox Dispatcher and Inbox] as LocalNotify

  Swing --> App : commands / queries
  App --> Domain : enforce rules
  App --> SQLite : atomic entity / posting / receipt / outbox writes
  LocalNotify --> SQLite : claim work / recheck membership / deduplicate
}

package "Complete product (separate delivery scope)" {
  [Web Client] as Web
  [Android App] as Android
  [iOS App] as IOS
  [Versioned REST API] as API
  [Shared Application and Domain] as SharedCore
  database "PostgreSQL" as Postgres
  cloud "Private Receipt Storage" as Receipts
  [Notification Outbox and Worker] as Worker
  [Email / Push / In-app Providers] as Providers

  Web --> API : HTTPS / JSON
  Android --> API : HTTPS / JSON
  IOS --> API : HTTPS / JSON
  API --> SharedCore : authorized use cases
  SharedCore --> Postgres : atomic repositories / receipts / pair guards / outbox
  SharedCore --> Receipts : authorized receipt port
  Worker --> Postgres : claim outbox / recheck access / retry
  Worker --> Providers : retryable delivery
}

note bottom of Swing
Desktop only; local data is not
shared across devices. Does not
satisfy FR-012.
end note
note bottom of API
Web, Android, and iOS are required
customer platforms, not part of
the desktop MVP. No Event Sourcing
or CQRS is selected.
end note
@enduml
